---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="The story and philosophy behind Clockwork Otter Foundry: focused software engineering in service of useful tools and creative work."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--content-max-width)] px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[var(--reading-max-width)]">
      <h1>About the Foundry</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        After 25 years as a software engineer, I started Clockwork Otter Foundry to build the
        kinds of tools I've always valued: focused, thoughtfully engineered software that helps
        people solve difficult problems.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        But the Foundry is about more than solving technical problems. I want to build tools that
        give people more room to create, whether they're telling stories, making art, or pursuing
        ideas that deserve the chance to become something real.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Technology shouldn't define the creative process. At its best, it should quietly handle
        the complexity, remove obstacles, and give people more freedom to make what they imagined.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
        Creativity is the goal. Software is the craft.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">— Rob G.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
